      "seoTitle": "AI & Automation for Indian Hotels | GooseLabs",
      "seoDescription": "Unified guest inbox, owner dashboards and AI follow-ups for Indian hotels and F&B businesses. Connect PMS, OTAs, Google and WhatsApp into one workflow.",
      "icon": "hotel",
