      "title": "Manufacturing & Industrial",
      "tagline": "Factories, plants, steel and production operations.",
      "seoTitle": "Computer Vision & AI for Indian Manufacturing | GooseLabs",
      "seoDescription": "Computer vision analytics, area mapping and efficiency dashboards for Indian factories and plants. See what is happening on the floor, not what was reported later.",
      "icon": "factory",
